extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ChvrCcq2lHwQ7kNvwE6z0ij&_nc_oc=Adp_meOUytYVXNOGSfgSZYt2GyRnkHBx6xK0eUoyaGSpOveOGY6UwXXZXQlUeHKq_Vo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPupk-IQrfa_KF6El8VOom09tCUmxkOk_nMXHWZL-Fesw&oe=6AC90656"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sBA98ZZ0uIIQ7kNvwH4eXpu&_nc_oc=AdprcyZWmdHabH2nLpUtOfFhc-iz5zxXglT4RwxqWA7HG7f0tvi2NQ8JmW3GyJ7X3xQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOyKIzL7eQEfpXzQmqfxWIl_Grk04Q64JjsoX32Vnf4hg&oe=6AC90DA2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CF3O9l1CMrMQ7kNvwE1ick3&_nc_oc=Adq4PRG-bExURnMq8ESqCKRI-Hw1UulfgQWlqjWK3kV3EXfUcfKfWwj7ZVaQHx4VM1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN3EJuu5_CPNhQrmcoJ58JB5Agi0mr_yvmOrnwighFJ6Q&oe=6AC91599"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":